# Compile allocation failure
# Positive log treats the injected failure as a non-match
# Negated log keeps the record
# Positive abort allows the statement
# Print replaces the original text
# Activation does not arm the replacement
# Short-circuit controls do not evaluate the regex
# Two failing conditions warn once each
# Output failures after a successful regex do not increment the regex counter
